  "body_html": "<p>If you like random art, I've just released a new tool for generating random rings and dots (in <code>&lt;svg&gt;</code>).</p>\n\n<p>With the editor, you can tweak a lot of parameters (Click the “Random!”-button to get started):</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fzqk33xqq9ya9l1ch4nqy.png\" class=\"article-body-image-wrapper\"><img src=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fzqk33xqq9ya9l1ch4nqy.png\" alt=\"Editor\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"630\" height=\"1268\"></a></p>\n\n<p>And render art like these examples: </p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fnlvfbt47s5wqh0cno0sw.png\" class=\"article-body-image-wrapper\"><img src=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fnlvfbt47s5wqh0cno0sw.png\" alt=\"image1\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\"></a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2F4do76jmyojg8a66ywbc5.png\" class=\"article-body-image-wrapper\"><img src=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2F4do76jmyojg8a66ywbc5.png\" alt=\"image2\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"709\" height=\"706\"></a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fp9tdje0g3b1y9pzeayrv.png\" class=\"article-body-image-wrapper\"><img src=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fp9tdje0g3b1y9pzeayrv.png\" alt=\"image3\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"802\"></a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fvp52mx2n159j7vatx2rk.png\" class=\"article-body-image-wrapper\"><img src=\"https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2Fvp52mx2n159j7vatx2rk.png\" alt=\"image4\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"800\" height=\"801\"></a></p>\n\n<p>When you've made a piece you'd like to save, click on “Export\", chose a file format, then click on “Save to Image”.</p>\n\n<p>It's on Codepen (open fullscreen for best experience):</p>\n\n<p><iframe height=\"600\" src=\"https://codepen.io/stoumann/embed/dyvprJM?height=600&amp;default-tab=result&amp;embed-version=2\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"no\" allowtransparency=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width: 100%;\">\n</iframe>\n</p>\n\n<p>Thanks for reading!</p>\n\n",
  "body_markdown": "If you like random art, I've just released a new tool for generating random rings and dots (in `<svg>`).\n\nWith the editor, you can tweak a lot of parameters (Click the “Random!”-button to get started):\n\n![Editor](https://dev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/articles/zqk33xqq9ya9l1ch4nqy.png)\n\nAnd render art like these examples: \n\n![image1](https://dev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/articles/nlvfbt47s5wqh0cno0sw.png)\n\n![image2](https://dev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/articles/4do76jmyojg8a66ywbc5.png)\n\n![image3](https://dev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/articles/p9tdje0g3b1y9pzeayrv.png)\n \n![image4](https://dev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/articles/vp52mx2n159j7vatx2rk.png)\n\nWhen you've made a piece you'd like to save, click on “Export\", chose a file format, then click on “Save to Image”.\n\nIt's on Codepen (open fullscreen for best experience):\n\n{% codepen https://codepen.io/stoumann/pen/dyvprJM %}\n\nThanks for reading!",
